    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d549">

                <pb facs="0621" n="517" sameAs="frus:frus1932v03/pg517"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/4576: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Switzerland
                        (Wilson), at Geneva</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-03-04T23:00:00-05:00">March 4, 1932—11 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>27. Your 52, March 4, 6 p.m., and 53, March 4, 9 p.m.</p>
                <p>Have telegraphed Shanghai requesting that American military authorities
                    cooperate. Inform Drummond.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
